(414135, 36827, 9809, '<td valign="top">Where did you find THIS machine still standing? This definitely hit my nostalgia nerve. I remember as a kid traveling across country with my parents on family vacations -- my dad wouldn''t stop at a station that charged more than 30 cents per gallon. Oh, those were the days...<br/> <br/>The photo speaks "volumes" but I think you''ve cropped it a bit too tight. I wouldn''t cut off the right and I''d give the top more breathing room. Cutting off the nozzle and hose works for me though. Nicely done.</td>', 'Where did you find THIS machine still standing? This definitely hit my nostalgia nerve. I remember as a kid traveling across country with my parents on family vacations -- my dad wouldn''t stop at a station that charged more than 30 cents per gallon. Oh, those were the days... The photo speaks "volumes" but I think you''ve cropped it a bit too tight. I wouldn''t cut off the right and I''d give the top more breathing room. Cutting off the nozzle and hose works for me though. Nicely done.', '2003-09-10 04:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(414137, 37072, 9809, '<td valign="top">The overall image is too blurry for my taste. It almost gives me a headache as my eyes try to focus on it. I''d increase the DOF, make sure it''s in focus, and shoot from the bottom of the game rather than the top -- but that''s just me.</td>', 'The overall image is too blurry for my taste. It almost gives me a headache as my eyes try to focus on it. I''d increase the DOF, make sure it''s in focus, and shoot from the bottom of the game rather than the top -- but that''s just me.', '2003-09-10 04:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(414141, 36948, 9809, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this is supposed to be Nostalgic, but it does remind me of the home of my youth. I''m not sure how many people would have that same experience.<br/> <br/>The border is too big and takes away from the overall image. If this were a large wall mount, the border would work, but for DPC 640x photos, more picture is better.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this is supposed to be Nostalgic, but it does remind me of the home of my youth. I''m not sure how many people would have that same experience. The border is too big and takes away from the overall image. If this were a large wall mount, the border would work, but for DPC 640x photos, more picture is better.', '2003-09-10 04:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(414143, 37044, 9809, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and great DOF and lighting.</td>', 'Interesting angle and great DOF and lighting.', '2003-09-10 04:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(414145, 37022, 9809, '<td valign="top">The chairs are a bit dark and the sky in the upper left looks blown out. I would love to see an old couple in the chairs, sipping iced tea.</td>', 'The chairs are a bit dark and the sky in the upper left looks blown out. I would love to see an old couple in the chairs, sipping iced tea.', '2003-09-10 04:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(414146, 37070, 10274, '<td valign="top">''nostalgia'' is captured very nicely in this photo,  very soft emotions come through in the lighting,very touching composition..</td>', '''nostalgia'' is captured very nicely in this photo,  very soft emotions come through in the lighting,very touching composition..', '2003-09-10 04:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(414147, 36641, 9809, '<td valign="top">This is one of those cases where cultural differences cause me to miss the nostalgia of the image. I was FORCED to do a google search to find out who Tan Kah Kee is/was. A little education never hurt anyone. I get it now.</td>', 'This is one of those cases where cultural differences cause me to miss the nostalgia of the image. I was FORCED to do a google search to find out who Tan Kah Kee is/was. A little education never hurt anyone. I get it now.', '2003-09-10 04:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(414150, 37119, 9809, '<td valign="top">What''s with the big honkin'' yellow boarder? This does nothing for the photo for me. Very clear rainbow and interesting that the sky is so much lighter below the rainbow. I''m surprised that with this bright of a rainbow I don''t see the second rainbow.</td>', 'What''s with the big honkin'' yellow boarder? This does nothing for the photo for me. Very clear rainbow and interesting that the sky is so much lighter below the rainbow. I''m surprised that with this bright of a rainbow I don''t see the second rainbow.', '2003-09-10 04:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(414151, 36808, 9809, '<td valign="top">It took me some time to figure out what I was looking at. The arm and needle should be sharper and the label could use some contrast so I could see the words better. Nice idea, nice angle to the shot, DOF needs work.</td>', 'It took me some time to figure out what I was looking at. The arm and needle should be sharper and the label could use some contrast so I could see the words better. Nice idea, nice angle to the shot, DOF needs work.', '2003-09-10 04:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
