(414162, 37219, 9809, '<td valign="top">My mother had the same headline paper in the Christmas ornament box. Every year, I''d read that article when we decorated the tree. Then one year, she pitched the old boxes and got new ones -- and pitched the paper too. "Why would I want to keep an old newspaper?" she asked. D''OH! See, you hit my nostalgia nerve. Nicely done.</td>', 'My mother had the same headline paper in the Christmas ornament box. Every year, I''d read that article when we decorated the tree. Then one year, she pitched the old boxes and got new ones -- and pitched the paper too. "Why would I want to keep an old newspaper?" she asked. D''OH! See, you hit my nostalgia nerve. Nicely done.', '2003-09-10 05:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
