(414283, 37032, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love the atmosphere and tones. The car stands out really well and the composition and angle of view really give the feeling as if it is just managing to roll over the top of the hill. Good fit to theme as well. 10 from me.</td>', 'Love the atmosphere and tones. The car stands out really well and the composition and angle of view really give the feeling as if it is just managing to roll over the top of the hill. Good fit to theme as well. 10 from me.', '2003-09-10 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
