(414390, 37115, 11111, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good fit for the challenge, too. Nicely framed as well.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good fit for the challenge, too. Nicely framed as well.', '2003-09-10 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(414391, 36998, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the challenge.  There seems to be a bit too much sky in the shot though.</td>', 'Nice idea for the challenge.  There seems to be a bit too much sky in the shot though.', '2003-09-10 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(414392, 36602, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is a beauty. Great subject for this challenge. Love the lighting.</td>', 'This is a beauty. Great subject for this challenge. Love the lighting.', '2003-09-10 10:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(414395, 37197, 11111, '<td valign="top">Interesting old stuff here. I think it''d be better if you''d cropped the brick bit at left out.</td>', 'Interesting old stuff here. I think it''d be better if you''d cropped the brick bit at left out.', '2003-09-10 10:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(414397, 36949, 11111, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and gentle colors here. Who knew eggs could be beautiful?</td>', 'Lovely lighting and gentle colors here. Who knew eggs could be beautiful?', '2003-09-10 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(414398, 36974, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, fits the challenge well.  I wonder if the photo would be more powerful if it were in color.</td>', 'Nice shot, fits the challenge well.  I wonder if the photo would be more powerful if it were in color.', '2003-09-10 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(414400, 37051, 10680, '<td valign="top">nice shot, the background goes well with it!</td>', 'nice shot, the background goes well with it!', '2003-09-10 11:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(414402, 36922, 10441, '<td valign="top">Ah yes...the good old days?  Nicely composed shot, good use of the rule of thirds!</td>', 'Ah yes...the good old days?  Nicely composed shot, good use of the rule of thirds!', '2003-09-10 11:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(414403, 36845, 11111, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Excellent exposure and framing. I''d like it better if the foreground at left were in better focus though.</td>', 'Nice shot. Excellent exposure and framing. I''d like it better if the foreground at left were in better focus though.', '2003-09-10 11:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(414404, 36819, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, great colors &amp; composition!</td>', 'Nicely done, great colors & composition!', '2003-09-10 11:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(414405, 37230, 11111, '<td valign="top">Unique subject matter. Cool perspective, though I really want to see those other watches, too!</td>', 'Unique subject matter. Cool perspective, though I really want to see those other watches, too!', '2003-09-10 11:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(414406, 36447, 10680, '<td valign="top">i personally feel that the light in the foreground is a little distracting</td>', 'i personally feel that the light in the foreground is a little distracting', '2003-09-10 11:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(414407, 36667, 11111, '<td valign="top">Pretty! I like the old radiator for a background, too.</td>', 'Pretty! I like the old radiator for a background, too.', '2003-09-10 11:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(414409, 36860, 10441, '<td valign="top">Beauty photo!  Well composed, great job of capturing the colors, I like the obscured reflection.</td>', 'Beauty photo!  Well composed, great job of capturing the colors, I like the obscured reflection.', '2003-09-10 11:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(414410, 36583, 10441, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of lighting for the shot.</td>', 'Interesting use of lighting for the shot.', '2003-09-10 11:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(414411, 37136, 11111, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the color in this. I think the composition would be stronger had you arranged the pictures so the viewer could see them better. I''m interested in seeing them!</td>', 'I particularly like the color in this. I think the composition would be stronger had you arranged the pictures so the viewer could see them better. I''m interested in seeing them!', '2003-09-10 11:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(414412, 37144, 10985, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the movie Cinema Paradiso. Nice angle. Maybe a little more contrast? But then, less contrast stresses the feeling of old photo.</td>', 'This reminds me of the movie Cinema Paradiso. Nice angle. Maybe a little more contrast? But then, less contrast stresses the feeling of old photo.', '2003-09-10 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(414413, 37232, 11111, '<td valign="top">Your suject is nicely balanced and you really captured the metal''s textures and aged quality well. It seems a little too tightly cropped at top.</td>', 'Your suject is nicely balanced and you really captured the metal''s textures and aged quality well. It seems a little too tightly cropped at top.', '2003-09-10 11:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(414414, 37140, 10680, '<td valign="top">cool picture! good use of reflection!</td>', 'cool picture! good use of reflection!', '2003-09-10 11:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(414416, 37130, 10985, '<td valign="top">A simple and effective shot, although the dirt on the table shows. Maybe a little less light on the right could have given a stronger mood and "cleaned" the table?</td>', 'A simple and effective shot, although the dirt on the table shows. Maybe a little less light on the right could have given a stronger mood and "cleaned" the table?', '2003-09-10 11:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(414417, 36447, 11111, '<td valign="top">Really good depth of field. Seems a little too tightly cropped at top and bottom. I think this would evoke "train station" more if I could see more of the tracks at bottom. Nice shot!</td>', 'Really good depth of field. Seems a little too tightly cropped at top and bottom. I think this would evoke "train station" more if I could see more of the tracks at bottom. Nice shot!', '2003-09-10 11:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(414419, 36822, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. If you''d cropped it a bit tighter at the top it might make it look as though it''s still running! I love the neutral background that shows just enough detail.</td>', 'This is beautiful. If you''d cropped it a bit tighter at the top it might make it look as though it''s still running! I love the neutral background that shows just enough detail.', '2003-09-10 11:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(414421, 37232, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, but more DOF would be great!</td>', 'Very good composition, but more DOF would be great!', '2003-09-10 11:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(414422, 36499, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Appears a little overexposed. Would like to see a sharper image in general. Love the composition- it tells a story! Appears as if the slouched, older guy in the shadows is watching the dad and girl and thinking back to helping his own kid ride a bike. Wonderful!</td>', 'Good shot. Appears a little overexposed. Would like to see a sharper image in general. Love the composition- it tells a story! Appears as if the slouched, older guy in the shadows is watching the dad and girl and thinking back to helping his own kid ride a bike. Wonderful!', '2003-09-10 11:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(414423, 37211, 10985, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. Bringing the structures farther from the wall would have enhanced this shot a lot. Especially if the wall was dark.</td>', 'Fun idea. Bringing the structures farther from the wall would have enhanced this shot a lot. Especially if the wall was dark.', '2003-09-10 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(414424, 36860, 11111, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard to me! Love the color!</td>', 'Looks like a postcard to me! Love the color!', '2003-09-10 11:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(414425, 36988, 11111, '<td valign="top">This certainly evokes nostalgia! Good job lighting and framing your objects!</td>', 'This certainly evokes nostalgia! Good job lighting and framing your objects!', '2003-09-10 11:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(414426, 37181, 10985, '<td valign="top">This makes me feel like I''m there, in those days. Very good!</td>', 'This makes me feel like I''m there, in those days. Very good!', '2003-09-10 11:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(414429, 36730, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wow. This tells a story!</td>', 'Wow. This tells a story!', '2003-09-10 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(414430, 37072, 10680, '<td valign="top">focus is very fuzzy</td>', 'focus is very fuzzy', '2003-09-10 11:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(414431, 37171, 10985, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2003-09-10 11:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(414432, 37174, 5475, '<td valign="top">The graphic impact of this image is very fun.  This collection of statues makes for a great composition.  I don''t know if you manipulated the colors or not, but I like the way it works here.  It has the feel of a BW image, but the sepia-yellow tints add warmth.  It also has great range from black in the background to the whites in the nearest bust.  The highlights appear to be a little blown on the nearest, but I think that adds to the feel of the image.  OVeral, lighting is very good.  The only thing I would prefer changed in this image would be to crop out the marble statue bases at the bottom (or shoot from a slightly different angle to exclude them).  Not a big deal, but the harsh geometric lines of the bases clash with the curves, forms , and textures of the statues (in my perception, anyway).  I''m giving this image a 10 because it has WOW factor!  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.  I hope to see this shot do well.<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'The graphic impact of this image is very fun.  This collection of statues makes for a great composition.  I don''t know if you manipulated the colors or not, but I like the way it works here.  It has the feel of a BW image, but the sepia-yellow tints add warmth.  It also has great range from black in the background to the whites in the nearest bust.  The highlights appear to be a little blown on the nearest, but I think that adds to the feel of the image.  OVeral, lighting is very good.  The only thing I would prefer changed in this image would be to crop out the marble statue bases at the bottom (or shoot from a slightly different angle to exclude them).  Not a big deal, but the harsh geometric lines of the bases clash with the curves, forms , and textures of the statues (in my perception, anyway).  I''m giving this image a 10 because it has WOW factor!  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.  I hope to see this shot do well.JD Anderson', '2003-09-10 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(414433, 37151, 11111, '<td valign="top">Might have been better had you shot at a vertical angle and gotten more of the house in the shot. Let''s see more of this cool old house! Your old house certainly fits the challenge. You''ve got some good shadows and detail here.</td>', 'Might have been better had you shot at a vertical angle and gotten more of the house in the shot. Let''s see more of this cool old house! Your old house certainly fits the challenge. You''ve got some good shadows and detail here.', '2003-09-10 11:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
