(414599, 37203, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tones, but the bright white at the top is a little distracting for me.</td>', 'I like the sepia tones, but the bright white at the top is a little distracting for me.', '2003-09-10 12:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
