(414722, 36348, 10720, '<td valign="top">In theme, but I found the picture pretty dark, plus I am not sure if the set up was ideal, the shapes don''t seem to complement each other in their current positions.</td>', 'In theme, but I found the picture pretty dark, plus I am not sure if the set up was ideal, the shapes don''t seem to complement each other in their current positions.', '2003-09-10 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
