(414940, 37044, 3554, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo for the challenge. The white areas feel a bit too bright but that''s really my only nitpick.</td>', 'Excellent photo for the challenge. The white areas feel a bit too bright but that''s really my only nitpick.', '2003-09-10 16:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
