(414944, 37149, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and angle of this shot. The wheels are a little over exposed but I think that adds something to this shot. The reflection helps a lot too. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the colors and angle of this shot. The wheels are a little over exposed but I think that adds something to this shot. The reflection helps a lot too. Nice work.', '2003-09-10 16:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
