(414947, 37230, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like it. Meets the challenge well and is a classic kind of shot. The only thing I don''t care for is the (light reflections??) in the in focus watch. If you could have gotten rid of those and added a little more light from the side I think it would have been an excellent shot.</td>', 'I like it. Meets the challenge well and is a classic kind of shot. The only thing I don''t care for is the (light reflections??) in the in focus watch. If you could have gotten rid of those and added a little more light from the side I think it would have been an excellent shot.', '2003-09-10 16:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
