(415369, 36722, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool pic.  i like the dof.  the choice of the photograph with the arrow in it is a nice touch.  it leads your eyes through...</td>', 'cool pic.  i like the dof.  the choice of the photograph with the arrow in it is a nice touch.  it leads your eyes through...', '2003-09-10 23:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
