(415393, 36536, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and concept, I''m not sure that I really care for the blue in this photo.</td>', 'Nice subject and concept, I''m not sure that I really care for the blue in this photo.', '2003-09-10 23:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
