(415398, 36453, 11073, '<td valign="top">if you were trying to make it look like an old time photo...it worked...otherwise too blown out imo.  nice subject though - good interpretation of the category...and the big fellow is framed in the shot well.  too bright for me...but something tells me you put a little more than average effort into this...6 for effort.</td>', 'if you were trying to make it look like an old time photo...it worked...otherwise too blown out imo.  nice subject though - good interpretation of the category...and the big fellow is framed in the shot well.  too bright for me...but something tells me you put a little more than average effort into this...6 for effort.', '2003-09-10 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(415399, 37182, 11073, '<td valign="top">:) man i still have that somewhere....i always hated the snes version...controls sucked...but the pc versions sure were fun.  And I thought that i was the only one who saved the boxes that the games came in =`)  But onto the shot....it''s framed very well, and at first i didn''t like the negative space up in the top right...but the longer i look at it...the more I''m glad its there.   good idea and execution....now to break out the snes emulator and play some old games :)</td>', ':) man i still have that somewhere....i always hated the snes version...controls sucked...but the pc versions sure were fun.  And I thought that i was the only one who saved the boxes that the games came in =`)  But onto the shot....it''s framed very well, and at first i didn''t like the negative space up in the top right...but the longer i look at it...the more I''m glad its there.   good idea and execution....now to break out the snes emulator and play some old games :)', '2003-09-10 23:59:07.000000', NULL, 1);
