(415503, 37121, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like this picture and the stone wall behind, but I think I would have tried to move the cat statue out of the picture (if possible) because to me it is a little distracting.  It takes away from the stove.  However, I realize that this might not have been an option and did not take off from my mark because of it.</td>', 'I like this picture and the stone wall behind, but I think I would have tried to move the cat statue out of the picture (if possible) because to me it is a little distracting.  It takes away from the stove.  However, I realize that this might not have been an option and did not take off from my mark because of it.', '2003-09-11 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(415506, 36348, 9387, '<td valign="top">This certainly is nostalgic and I like it a lot.  My only comment would be that maybe you could have done this in a manner to allow the ball, glove and catchers mask stand out a little more from the background.  However, I realize this might your personal artistic representation and this is just my opinion.</td>', 'This certainly is nostalgic and I like it a lot.  My only comment would be that maybe you could have done this in a manner to allow the ball, glove and catchers mask stand out a little more from the background.  However, I realize this might your personal artistic representation and this is just my opinion.', '2003-09-11 01:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(415507, 36819, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great color and good movement through the scene in size.  I like this.</td>', 'Great color and good movement through the scene in size.  I like this.', '2003-09-11 01:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(415509, 36981, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.</td>', 'Very good photo.', '2003-09-11 01:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
