(416015, 37183, 3102, '<td valign="top">An Oregon Classic!  :)</td>', 'An Oregon Classic!  :)', '2003-09-11 15:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(416022, 36976, 3102, '<td valign="top">You might want to check your method of resizing the shot -- it looks like some of the details got a little funky upon resizing.  In other words, as an example you can see that the man''s back is a bit jagged rather than being a smooth curve.  I''ll be glad to lend a hand if you want to PM me.</td>', 'You might want to check your method of resizing the shot -- it looks like some of the details got a little funky upon resizing.  In other words, as an example you can see that the man''s back is a bit jagged rather than being a smooth curve.  I''ll be glad to lend a hand if you want to PM me.', '2003-09-11 15:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(416031, 36947, 5364, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, and but for the TV aerials you  got away with it. At least there weren''t any satellite dishes.</td>', 'Nice picture, and but for the TV aerials you  got away with it. At least there weren''t any satellite dishes.', '2003-09-11 15:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(416039, 37220, 7682, '<td valign="top">Looks a little jagged - Not fond of the circular border</td>', 'Looks a little jagged - Not fond of the circular border', '2003-09-11 15:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(416043, 37232, 7682, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF &amp; Hue - Good shot</td>', 'Nice DOF & Hue - Good shot', '2003-09-11 15:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(416045, 37120, 7682, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh + I hate care bears</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh + I hate care bears', '2003-09-11 15:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(416055, 36679, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been even better had you pulled back and captured the wheels and the front thingy (don''t know what it''s called) on the train.  but cropping it so high, we miss some nice components. I like the sepia and the nice clear image though.</td>', 'I think this would have been even better had you pulled back and captured the wheels and the front thingy (don''t know what it''s called) on the train.  but cropping it so high, we miss some nice components. I like the sepia and the nice clear image though.', '2003-09-11 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(416056, 36812, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the look of nostalgia on his face as he looks, not so much on the picture, but through it, to another place and time.</td>', 'I like how you captured the look of nostalgia on his face as he looks, not so much on the picture, but through it, to another place and time.', '2003-09-11 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(416073, 37209, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge. I love the angle from which you shot and the details captured, from the intricate pattern of the tile floor to the tear in the first seat cushion. To me, this has a great nostalgic feel to it. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge. I love the angle from which you shot and the details captured, from the intricate pattern of the tile floor to the tear in the first seat cushion. To me, this has a great nostalgic feel to it. Nicely done.', '2003-09-11 16:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(416075, 36453, 9295, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say "nostalgic" to me, but I love the picture so much I''m not even taking that into consideration with my voting this time.  I''m not exactly sure what it is, maybe the pinkish tones or the stark white bottom, or maybe it''s just the look in the beast''s eye that captures my attention. Whatever it is, I think this is a great shot.  Is that a second buffalo lying down on the left there?  I think it''d be better without him but that''s ok.  Still one of my favorites.</td>', 'This doesn''t really say "nostalgic" to me, but I love the picture so much I''m not even taking that into consideration with my voting this time.  I''m not exactly sure what it is, maybe the pinkish tones or the stark white bottom, or maybe it''s just the look in the beast''s eye that captures my attention. Whatever it is, I think this is a great shot.  Is that a second buffalo lying down on the left there?  I think it''d be better without him but that''s ok.  Still one of my favorites.', '2003-09-11 17:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(416077, 36633, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better had you actually had a little boy in the shot playing with these toys and perhaps some different lighting would make it a little more interesting.  As it is, it fits the theme of the challenge ok, but it just doesn''t say too much as a photograph.</td>', 'I think this might have worked better had you actually had a little boy in the shot playing with these toys and perhaps some different lighting would make it a little more interesting.  As it is, it fits the theme of the challenge ok, but it just doesn''t say too much as a photograph.', '2003-09-11 17:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(416079, 36817, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, certainly nostalgic. Taking your focal point off-center  a little bit might have added a even more interest to the photo.  Nice sepia and I like the fact that there are no clouds in the sky to detract from the pumps.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a great shot, certainly nostalgic. Taking your focal point off-center  a little bit might have added a even more interest to the photo.  Nice sepia and I like the fact that there are no clouds in the sky to detract from the pumps.  Nicely done.', '2003-09-11 17:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(416121, 36560, 11254, '<td valign="top">i like the colors in this photo... they are so plain yet energizing..good shot. looks like you have some distortion though</td>', 'i like the colors in this photo... they are so plain yet energizing..good shot. looks like you have some distortion though', '2003-09-11 18:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(416122, 36400, 11254, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!! where was this!? it makes a great mood because of the singled out object..beautiful colors ago...nice shot</td>', 'beautiful shot!! where was this!? it makes a great mood because of the singled out object..beautiful colors ago...nice shot', '2003-09-11 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(416124, 37001, 10799, '<td valign="top">a different angle might have eliminated the distraction on the left.</td>', 'a different angle might have eliminated the distraction on the left.', '2003-09-11 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(416150, 37102, 10833, '<td valign="top">Bed-wetting? LOL!!  I''m assuming that is a fake letter..if not.. urm.. sorry for laughing at your pain :(</td>', 'Bed-wetting? LOL!!  I''m assuming that is a fake letter..if not.. urm.. sorry for laughing at your pain :(', '2003-09-11 19:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(416165, 36947, 10510, '<td valign="top">How quaint.  Very lovely place.</td>', 'How quaint.  Very lovely place.', '2003-09-11 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(416166, 37199, 3697, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is beautiful. The duo-tone colors are just perfect, the focus is sharp as a tack, and the composition is awesome.</td>', 'Wow, this is beautiful. The duo-tone colors are just perfect, the focus is sharp as a tack, and the composition is awesome.', '2003-09-11 19:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(416170, 36744, 10510, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the colors in the beautiful decor.  A fire in the fire place would have made the very formal room look a bit cozier and invite more of a nostalgia feeling,  but overall I like the photo.</td>', 'Good capture of the colors in the beautiful decor.  A fire in the fire place would have made the very formal room look a bit cozier and invite more of a nostalgia feeling,  but overall I like the photo.', '2003-09-11 19:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(416177, 36766, 10510, '<td valign="top">I''m sure many people cried today in remembrance.  I shed some tears myself.  The emotions of this tragic day will never be forgotten.</td>', 'I''m sure many people cried today in remembrance.  I shed some tears myself.  The emotions of this tragic day will never be forgotten.', '2003-09-11 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(416181, 37119, 10510, '<td valign="top">I love rainbows!  Picture would be better with the person on the right cropped out.</td>', 'I love rainbows!  Picture would be better with the person on the right cropped out.', '2003-09-11 20:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(416182, 37115, 7474, '<td valign="top">lovely shot and it really captures the feeling of<br/>nostalgia :)<br/>I would have loved to see it with all lamps turned on though. <br/>Still, you did a great job ! 9</td>', 'lovely shot and it really captures the feeling ofnostalgia :)I would have loved to see it with all lamps turned on though. Still, you did a great job ! 9', '2003-09-11 20:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(416184, 37129, 10510, '<td valign="top">Just last week at a family reunion I saw some old 1945 Army pictures of my dad, so this one is pure nostalgia to me.</td>', 'Just last week at a family reunion I saw some old 1945 Army pictures of my dad, so this one is pure nostalgia to me.', '2003-09-11 20:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(416185, 36970, 7474, '<td valign="top">great lighting and composition !<br/>The sepia tones really help to enhance the feeling of nostalgia :)<br/>beautiful capture :) 9</td>', 'great lighting and composition !The sepia tones really help to enhance the feeling of nostalgia :)beautiful capture :) 9', '2003-09-11 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(416187, 36634, 7474, '<td valign="top">what I really like about this pic besides the perfect <br/>technical execution, is that you almost can imagine<br/>how life must have been in this age.<br/>Really beautiful submission for the nostalgia theme :) 10</td>', 'what I really like about this pic besides the perfect technical execution, is that you almost can imaginehow life must have been in this age.Really beautiful submission for the nostalgia theme :) 10', '2003-09-11 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(416188, 37142, 10510, '<td valign="top">Is this the same guy that was feeding the squirrel in a previous challenge?  Beautuful place to be.</td>', 'Is this the same guy that was feeding the squirrel in a previous challenge?  Beautuful place to be.', '2003-09-11 20:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
