(416192, 36411, 10510, '<td valign="top">My ex used to build these, so this is pure nostalgia to me.  I would have rather seen a picture of the bike on the road though, plus maybe a clearer image.  Love it.</td>', 'My ex used to build these, so this is pure nostalgia to me.  I would have rather seen a picture of the bike on the road though, plus maybe a clearer image.  Love it.', '2003-09-11 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(416193, 36680, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful in every aspect,<br/>the red with the chrome works great<br/>and the image composition is perfect !10</td>', 'beautiful in every aspect,the red with the chrome works greatand the image composition is perfect !10', '2003-09-11 20:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(416194, 36447, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very good subject, very nicely composed, and great focus. The only thing I would change is the fact that the sky seems overly blown out. But still, it''s a very nice photo and definately meets the assignment topic.</td>', 'Very good subject, very nicely composed, and great focus. The only thing I would change is the fact that the sky seems overly blown out. But still, it''s a very nice photo and definately meets the assignment topic.', '2003-09-11 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(416196, 36610, 3697, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an incredible scene. The darkness and lightness of the black and white is extraordinary, and your composition is perfect. Simply awesome.</td>', 'Wow, what an incredible scene. The darkness and lightness of the black and white is extraordinary, and your composition is perfect. Simply awesome.', '2003-09-11 20:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(416197, 37209, 7474, '<td valign="top">very stylish and straight forward shot.<br/>love the clean lines and different patterns.<br/>You should make this one available as a print ! 10</td>', 'very stylish and straight forward shot.love the clean lines and different patterns.You should make this one available as a print ! 10', '2003-09-11 20:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(416199, 37069, 10510, '<td valign="top">by the dash board lights.  10</td>', 'by the dash board lights.  10', '2003-09-11 20:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(416201, 37141, 10510, '<td valign="top">I like this mainly because I am a collector of antique jewelry.  I think you captured the pieces very well.</td>', 'I like this mainly because I am a collector of antique jewelry.  I think you captured the pieces very well.', '2003-09-11 20:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(416202, 37227, 6667, '<td valign="top">I llike this shot. It reminds me of many that are in our newspaper featuring athletes of the year .  They would certainly wane nostalgic looking back on a phot like this.  My only comment is the rectangle cropping.  Is there something happening to the left and right that prohibited a square cropping? Ok two comments:  the sun needed to be shaded somewhat.  The squints detract.  Best of luck.  BTW: What college?</td>', 'I llike this shot. It reminds me of many that are in our newspaper featuring athletes of the year .  They would certainly wane nostalgic looking back on a phot like this.  My only comment is the rectangle cropping.  Is there something happening to the left and right that prohibited a square cropping? Ok two comments:  the sun needed to be shaded somewhat.  The squints detract.  Best of luck.  BTW: What college?', '2003-09-11 20:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
