(416601, 37130, 11811, '<td valign="top">excellent, original</td>', 'excellent, original', '2003-09-12 05:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(416602, 36669, 11811, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2003-09-12 05:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(416603, 36817, 11811, '<td valign="top">very good.</td>', 'very good.', '2003-09-12 05:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(416605, 37020, 11811, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2003-09-12 05:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(416606, 36516, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this should take me back to another time. 4</td>', 'I don''t see how this should take me back to another time. 4', '2003-09-12 05:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(416607, 36746, 11811, '<td valign="top">l love it</td>', 'l love it', '2003-09-12 05:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(416608, 37140, 11811, '<td valign="top">very nice shot</td>', 'very nice shot', '2003-09-12 05:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(416609, 36411, 11811, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2003-09-12 05:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(416611, 36627, 8522, '<td valign="top">But this only happened recently... how is it nostalgic? 3</td>', 'But this only happened recently... how is it nostalgic? 3', '2003-09-12 05:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(416612, 36819, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, incredible clarity and saturation. Great exposure. Shame the picture can''t be larger. The border is effective. I''d have liked the crop a little less tight though. 8</td>', 'Wow, incredible clarity and saturation. Great exposure. Shame the picture can''t be larger. The border is effective. I''d have liked the crop a little less tight though. 8', '2003-09-12 05:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(416613, 37191, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh I LOVE the addition of that tourist. Brilliant. 7</td>', 'Oh I LOVE the addition of that tourist. Brilliant. 7', '2003-09-12 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(416614, 37219, 11811, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent shot. original. right to the point</td>', 'this is an excellent shot. original. right to the point', '2003-09-12 05:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(416615, 36948, 8522, '<td valign="top">That is one ENORMOUS border, and I can''t see how a field full of trees is nostalgic. 4</td>', 'That is one ENORMOUS border, and I can''t see how a field full of trees is nostalgic. 4', '2003-09-12 05:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(416618, 37000, 8522, '<td valign="top">Finally, a use of selective desaturation that''s appropriate! Composition seems to be missing something though... 6</td>', 'Finally, a use of selective desaturation that''s appropriate! Composition seems to be missing something though... 6', '2003-09-12 05:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(416619, 37220, 8522, '<td valign="top">Why that border? And it looks even worse without anti-aliasing. 3</td>', 'Why that border? And it looks even worse without anti-aliasing. 3', '2003-09-12 05:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(416621, 37081, 11811, '<td valign="top">original, very good</td>', 'original, very good', '2003-09-12 06:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(416624, 36994, 11811, '<td valign="top">wow, this is a great shot</td>', 'wow, this is a great shot', '2003-09-12 06:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(416625, 36680, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice, exquisite hue and saturation, great lighting on the reflective metal which can''t have been easy. Absolutely no glare! Border works well. Nice composition, good crop. My favourite and highest scoring pic this challenge. 9</td>', 'Very nice, exquisite hue and saturation, great lighting on the reflective metal which can''t have been easy. Absolutely no glare! Border works well. Nice composition, good crop. My favourite and highest scoring pic this challenge. 9', '2003-09-12 06:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(416626, 37100, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. Impressed that there''s no distortion at the edges. Great selection of items and very good exposure. Perfect saturation. 8</td>', 'I love this picture. Impressed that there''s no distortion at the edges. Great selection of items and very good exposure. Perfect saturation. 8', '2003-09-12 06:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(416628, 36813, 11570, '<td valign="top">I think I can see that you were trying get that wistfull look.  Her expression is OK but IMO the effect would have been multiplied and allowed me to vote higher if you had taken this at  location e.g.railway station (older style) that would have evoked and echoed her expression.  In other words something to suggest the reason for the wistfull look.<br/> <br/>Composition and setting wise the strong flash - I would have used a  reflector at the left to reduce the effect of the shadow and tried to position her so that the curtain did not cut her face in half.</td>', 'I think I can see that you were trying get that wistfull look.  Her expression is OK but IMO the effect would have been multiplied and allowed me to vote higher if you had taken this at  location e.g.railway station (older style) that would have evoked and echoed her expression.  In other words something to suggest the reason for the wistfull look. Composition and setting wise the strong flash - I would have used a  reflector at the left to reduce the effect of the shadow and tried to position her so that the curtain did not cut her face in half.', '2003-09-12 06:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(416629, 37139, 11570, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation.  However, I do think that the composition could hve been stronger by cropping the foreground and bringing the subject into the "thirds rule".<br/> <br/>Far away look need not be so far away in the picture.</td>', 'Good interpretation.  However, I do think that the composition could hve been stronger by cropping the foreground and bringing the subject into the "thirds rule". Far away look need not be so far away in the picture.', '2003-09-12 06:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(416632, 36996, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nice concept - I love those old valve radios.<br/> <br/>Obviously a "studio" shot. I would have liked it even more if it was in a room context.  Either old phto on the wall or even a modern room to amke the contrast.</td>', 'Nice concept - I love those old valve radios. Obviously a "studio" shot. I would have liked it even more if it was in a room context.  Either old phto on the wall or even a modern room to amke the contrast.', '2003-09-12 06:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(416643, 36921, 12114, '<td valign="top">A brilliant idea...</td>', 'A brilliant idea...', '2003-09-12 07:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(416644, 36553, 12114, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.</td>', 'I like this idea.', '2003-09-12 07:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(416648, 36993, 9854, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but somehow, I prefer seeing green foliage rather than desaturated like this.</td>', 'Good picture, but somehow, I prefer seeing green foliage rather than desaturated like this.', '2003-09-12 07:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(416652, 36299, 11570, '<td valign="top">Shades of childhood remembered - well expressed.<br/> <br/>I would have prefered the focus sharper, though if you have use a soft focus filter IMO it does fit the particular subject i.e child at the beach.</td>', 'Shades of childhood remembered - well expressed. I would have prefered the focus sharper, though if you have use a soft focus filter IMO it does fit the particular subject i.e child at the beach.', '2003-09-12 07:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(416653, 36922, 11570, '<td valign="top">Not so much nostalgia (for me at least) more a case of glad I did not live during that period whent the privy was outside!!!!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Not so much nostalgia (for me at least) more a case of glad I did not live during that period whent the privy was outside!!!!!!! ', '2003-09-12 07:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(416654, 36540, 11570, '<td valign="top">More times past than nostalgia but well seen and composed image.</td>', 'More times past than nostalgia but well seen and composed image.', '2003-09-12 07:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
