(416824, 37209, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work.  I love nicely toned black and whites, so that''s always a plus :)  This is a strong photo for me for several reasons... first of all, it meets the challenge well.  This is quite nostalgic since these types of ''greasy spoon'' places are fading into the past these days.  There aren''t many like it around anymore.  Secondly, you chose an interestin perspective and composition for this shot.  You chose a non-literal view which creates nice ''geometries'' in the photo and a nice strong diagonal as well.  This looks like a place I would want to go for a burger and fries and a chocolate malt with a pretty girl on a friday night :)  <br/> <br/>Don''t you wish you had done this shot for the ''repetition'' challenge? :)<br/> <br/>Excellent showing... = 10<br/></td>', 'This is excellent work.  I love nicely toned black and whites, so that''s always a plus :)  This is a strong photo for me for several reasons... first of all, it meets the challenge well.  This is quite nostalgic since these types of ''greasy spoon'' places are fading into the past these days.  There aren''t many like it around anymore.  Secondly, you chose an interestin perspective and composition for this shot.  You chose a non-literal view which creates nice ''geometries'' in the photo and a nice strong diagonal as well.  This looks like a place I would want to go for a burger and fries and a chocolate malt with a pretty girl on a friday night :)   Don''t you wish you had done this shot for the ''repetition'' challenge? :) Excellent showing... = 10', '2003-09-12 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
