(417066, 36961, 12131, '<td valign="top">OOOooh, a gaff rigged....ketch?  No this is bigger.  I''m not sure but I love ships with more than one mast.  Love the open sea too, this presents mucho possibilities about where you are going, where you came from...great.</td>', 'OOOooh, a gaff rigged....ketch?  No this is bigger.  I''m not sure but I love ships with more than one mast.  Love the open sea too, this presents mucho possibilities about where you are going, where you came from...great.', '2003-09-12 16:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
