(417072, 36805, 12131, '<td valign="top">Like your use of sunglasses.  It adds something of a  mood to the sunset.  Though I think it would have looked nice by itself as well.  Perhaps your protecting the lens?</td>', 'Like your use of sunglasses.  It adds something of a  mood to the sunset.  Though I think it would have looked nice by itself as well.  Perhaps your protecting the lens?', '2003-09-12 16:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
