(417082, 36981, 12131, '<td valign="top">Something about those colors makes me think America.  And that broom makes me think Salem.  For me, that''s a bit contrasting and I like it.</td>', 'Something about those colors makes me think America.  And that broom makes me think Salem.  For me, that''s a bit contrasting and I like it.', '2003-09-12 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
