(418003, 37129, 9441, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of the old war days....</td>', 'Good portrayal of the old war days....', '2003-09-13 15:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(418009, 37172, 9523, '<td valign="top">I miss the French Franc so much. The Euro is an atrocity. It''s the EU''s first step towards eliminating everything that makes a country separate from other countries, this first step being the elimination of separate currency. People''s argument that they don''t have to exchange money anymore is invalid and stupid. Exchanging takes how long, 5 minutes with a 3-minute wait?<br/>I''m giving this a 10 because it''s symbolic of the way that the powers that be are out to crush individuality at any expense.<br/>Are these from a trip to France ou est-ce que vous y habitez?</td>', 'I miss the French Franc so much. The Euro is an atrocity. It''s the EU''s first step towards eliminating everything that makes a country separate from other countries, this first step being the elimination of separate currency. People''s argument that they don''t have to exchange money anymore is invalid and stupid. Exchanging takes how long, 5 minutes with a 3-minute wait?I''m giving this a 10 because it''s symbolic of the way that the powers that be are out to crush individuality at any expense.Are these from a trip to France ou est-ce que vous y habitez?', '2003-09-13 15:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418024, 36583, 7778, '<td valign="top">This, catagorically, multi-faceted photo is so credibly set-up, it could pass as a candid. The (for a portrait or self-portrait) somewhat unflattering lighting falling diagonally through the shot lends considerable drama and realism to what could have made for a sweeter and (artistically) weaker image without this. The soft focus compensates aptly in this respect.<br/> <br/>Most striking, to me, is the strong integrity of this shot, supported by a convincing arrangement and an apparent authenticity of choices. The facial expression and ''cast'' of the subject alone communicate the full gamut of human emotion, far beyond the defined topic.<br/> <br/>The image is ''transporting'' to the extreme, and, IMO, a model fit for study. &gt; 9</td>', 'This, catagorically, multi-faceted photo is so credibly set-up, it could pass as a candid. The (for a portrait or self-portrait) somewhat unflattering lighting falling diagonally through the shot lends considerable drama and realism to what could have made for a sweeter and (artistically) weaker image without this. The soft focus compensates aptly in this respect. Most striking, to me, is the strong integrity of this shot, supported by a convincing arrangement and an apparent authenticity of choices. The facial expression and ''cast'' of the subject alone communicate the full gamut of human emotion, far beyond the defined topic. The image is ''transporting'' to the extreme, and, IMO, a model fit for study. > 9', '2003-09-13 17:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(418026, 37226, 12151, '<td valign="top">This would be an 8 or 9 if it were a clearer image - otherwise, I think it''s great- haha.</td>', 'This would be an 8 or 9 if it were a clearer image - otherwise, I think it''s great- haha.', '2003-09-13 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(418039, 37144, 6172, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s it now.  The object of the challenge is to take us to a time in the past.</td>', 'Yes, that''s it now.  The object of the challenge is to take us to a time in the past.', '2003-09-13 18:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(418041, 37020, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo (Goldfield? and the Superstition Mtns. in the background).  I personally feel the effect would have been better with b&amp;w.  The bars running off the sides of the photo from the watertower are a little distracting.</td>', 'Very nice photo (Goldfield? and the Superstition Mtns. in the background).  I personally feel the effect would have been better with b&w.  The bars running off the sides of the photo from the watertower are a little distracting.', '2003-09-13 18:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(418042, 37040, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Don''t like the wire at the top of the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Don''t like the wire at the top of the photo.', '2003-09-13 18:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(418044, 36827, 6172, '<td valign="top">Here\''s some heavy nostalgia.</td>', 'Here\''s some heavy nostalgia.', '2003-09-13 18:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(418046, 36411, 3343, '<td valign="top">Is this the real bike and where is it?</td>', 'Is this the real bike and where is it?', '2003-09-13 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(418048, 37153, 3343, '<td valign="top">See how good you would look with a shave and hair cut. Great concept.</td>', 'See how good you would look with a shave and hair cut. Great concept.', '2003-09-13 18:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(418050, 37172, 3032, '<td valign="top">Oui, oui, el euro zuigt schrecklich! :)<br/>But seriously, its not that bad (from a heavy pin, chipknip, paypal and CC user).<br/> <br/>Would have liked to see coins only, not the white stuff underneath it.</td>', 'Oui, oui, el euro zuigt schrecklich! :)But seriously, its not that bad (from a heavy pin, chipknip, paypal and CC user). Would have liked to see coins only, not the white stuff underneath it.', '2003-09-13 19:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(418059, 36981, 3032, '<td valign="top">Simple it is, but the colors work great.<br/>Nice scene, good composition. 9</td>', 'Simple it is, but the colors work great.Nice scene, good composition. 9', '2003-09-13 19:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(418061, 37219, 63, '<td valign="top">I remember that sad day - 8</td>', 'I remember that sad day - 8', '2003-09-13 19:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(418063, 36680, 3032, '<td valign="top">The details on those old american cars are just beatiful. Sometimes something like this can be more beatiful then the car itself.<br/>Love the compostion of this, it looks like a spaceship that just came to a halt on a distant planet. Good capture of the chrome and surroundings. Excellent, 9.</td>', 'The details on those old american cars are just beatiful. Sometimes something like this can be more beatiful then the car itself.Love the compostion of this, it looks like a spaceship that just came to a halt on a distant planet. Good capture of the chrome and surroundings. Excellent, 9.', '2003-09-13 19:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(418064, 36773, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo.<br/>All this motion yet a peaceful scene.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful photo.All this motion yet a peaceful scene.', '2003-09-13 19:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(418066, 36813, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Love the lighting, how it seems to draw attention to the face and the eyes. The toning is great as well, the balance in tones is so good.<br/>The only distraction is the black patch behind the head.<br/>Nice border.</td>', 'Great portrait. Love the lighting, how it seems to draw attention to the face and the eyes. The toning is great as well, the balance in tones is so good.The only distraction is the black patch behind the head.Nice border.', '2003-09-13 19:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(418067, 36583, 3032, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo that is taken in the ealry seventies. It somehow sparkles the imagination; is this some kind of CIA spy, calling his office to give an update on the one he is observing? (and stuff like that)<br/> <br/>Nice work, like it how the lighting and colors work out here.</td>', 'Looks like a photo that is taken in the ealry seventies. It somehow sparkles the imagination; is this some kind of CIA spy, calling his office to give an update on the one he is observing? (and stuff like that) Nice work, like it how the lighting and colors work out here.', '2003-09-13 19:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(418068, 36610, 3032, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the fill flash could be a little less strong, but nice photo anyway. The sky is what makes it work.</td>', 'Perhaps the fill flash could be a little less strong, but nice photo anyway. The sky is what makes it work.', '2003-09-13 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(418070, 36973, 3032, '<td valign="top">Psychedelic colors work great. The photo seems to communicate a certain mood. If you know the music (I hardly) do it would be complete I guess.<br/>Like it.</td>', 'Psychedelic colors work great. The photo seems to communicate a certain mood. If you know the music (I hardly) do it would be complete I guess.Like it.', '2003-09-13 19:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
