(419201, 37001, 12169, '<td valign="top">Yeah good, but I think to really pull off what you''re looking for you needed a bit more ''modern'' in your contradiction.</td>', 'Yeah good, but I think to really pull off what you''re looking for you needed a bit more ''modern'' in your contradiction.', '2003-09-15 03:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
