(419722, 37128, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like this. Mars is just below and to the right of the moon but lost in the glare. The stars of the constellation capricornus are however quite visible to the right. 10</td>', 'I like this. Mars is just below and to the right of the moon but lost in the glare. The stars of the constellation capricornus are however quite visible to the right. 10', '2003-09-15 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(419743, 36668, 6008, '<td valign="top">This conjures up an image of Fred Astaire dancing with top hat, tails, and of course the cane. The gradient background from light to dark is interesting, and compositionally it''s good, although perhaps cropping the bottom off just below the cane gives it a much stronger diagonal, but then it seems the hat looks a little unbalanced that way. I admit to not being a fan of the tight vertical crop, but that''s a personal preference - it''s like a crumb instead of the whole cookie. This frame, however, introduces a glimpse into the past.</td>', 'This conjures up an image of Fred Astaire dancing with top hat, tails, and of course the cane. The gradient background from light to dark is interesting, and compositionally it''s good, although perhaps cropping the bottom off just below the cane gives it a much stronger diagonal, but then it seems the hat looks a little unbalanced that way. I admit to not being a fan of the tight vertical crop, but that''s a personal preference - it''s like a crumb instead of the whole cookie. This frame, however, introduces a glimpse into the past.', '2003-09-15 15:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(419744, 36999, 6008, '<td valign="top">I cant really tell if these items have been collected and posed or they are a bronze statue, although the outdoor setting and the same tonal range does support the latter. Having the grenade partially cropped out is a little disappointing, but I''m guessing there was something distracting right next to it. Having that go against the small gap between the edge and the boots unbalances the picture a little. The choice of sepia ages the image well. The subject is interesting, I just think the composition let you down a little with this particular image.</td>', 'I cant really tell if these items have been collected and posed or they are a bronze statue, although the outdoor setting and the same tonal range does support the latter. Having the grenade partially cropped out is a little disappointing, but I''m guessing there was something distracting right next to it. Having that go against the small gap between the edge and the boots unbalances the picture a little. The choice of sepia ages the image well. The subject is interesting, I just think the composition let you down a little with this particular image.', '2003-09-15 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(419758, 37117, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is slightly oversharpened or slighty overexposed. The pictures seem a little too bright, and the camera has lost some of its details. It could just need a little more contrast. The choice of sepia ages the image well. Overall it does an ample job of representing nostalgia.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is slightly oversharpened or slighty overexposed. The pictures seem a little too bright, and the camera has lost some of its details. It could just need a little more contrast. The choice of sepia ages the image well. Overall it does an ample job of representing nostalgia.', '2003-09-15 15:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(419762, 36417, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed was how nicely the window framed the shot. The sepia and darker tone does a great job of aging it. It certainly sends the viewer back to a time when this vehicle was in its heyday. It has a good contrasting tonal range and the background is not distracting from the interior of the truck.</td>', 'The first thing I noticed was how nicely the window framed the shot. The sepia and darker tone does a great job of aging it. It certainly sends the viewer back to a time when this vehicle was in its heyday. It has a good contrasting tonal range and the background is not distracting from the interior of the truck.', '2003-09-15 15:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(419786, 37130, 7682, '<td valign="top">Classic...Was going to do something like this also.  Need more colors though.  It''s sort of bland</td>', 'Classic...Was going to do something like this also.  Need more colors though.  It''s sort of bland', '2003-09-15 15:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
