(419852, 36526, 12131, '<td valign="top">Yeah, well, I don''t know if it is a nestalgia so much as something that is still being worked on.  After all, it is considered a living religion and tradition, they don''t necessarily wish for the past or regret it''s passing, (infact I hope not, considering the bloody mess Christianities history holds).  Still I like the imagery because it could go for any form of reading or tradition in which books played a heavy part.</td>', 'Yeah, well, I don''t know if it is a nestalgia so much as something that is still being worked on.  After all, it is considered a living religion and tradition, they don''t necessarily wish for the past or regret it''s passing, (infact I hope not, considering the bloody mess Christianities history holds).  Still I like the imagery because it could go for any form of reading or tradition in which books played a heavy part.', '2003-09-15 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(419853, 37231, 12131, '<td valign="top">The water coming off the wheel presents a possibility of time going by and the old joining the large expanse of past that is the lake, while the water coming in is unseen off the right of the picture waiting it''s turn to turn the wheel.</td>', 'The water coming off the wheel presents a possibility of time going by and the old joining the large expanse of past that is the lake, while the water coming in is unseen off the right of the picture waiting it''s turn to turn the wheel.', '2003-09-15 16:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
