(420196, 36761, 8125, '<td valign="top">Nice subject - it seems a little too light - maybe overexposed a tad, but then I''m being picky.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice subject - it seems a little too light - maybe overexposed a tad, but then I''m being picky.  Good work.', '2003-09-15 23:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(420198, 37231, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot - I like the reflection. It would be a bit better if the reflection showed the whole structure, instead of being cut off at the bottom.  I like how you got the tunnel to the left and the fence in the background.  This seems like a very peaceful place.  You captured a lot of elements in one shot.  Good work.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot - I like the reflection. It would be a bit better if the reflection showed the whole structure, instead of being cut off at the bottom.  I like how you got the tunnel to the left and the fence in the background.  This seems like a very peaceful place.  You captured a lot of elements in one shot.  Good work.', '2003-09-15 23:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(420201, 37139, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  The picture is quite clear (at least to my not always so terribly good eyes) all the way from the front to the way back.  I love the crop.  The big, empty (but not so empty - with the paint and cracks and leaves and so on) space in front is quite fascinating, and the top part of the picture, with the man sitting there looking at a photo (is that what he''s looking at?), with the line of trees on each side, all the leaves on the floor - this is just right for nostalgia.  It''s making me homesick right now, even though I don''t know what for.  I love the sepia tones - they, and the picture, are very well done.  My favourite!  ~10</td>', 'Very interesting.  The picture is quite clear (at least to my not always so terribly good eyes) all the way from the front to the way back.  I love the crop.  The big, empty (but not so empty - with the paint and cracks and leaves and so on) space in front is quite fascinating, and the top part of the picture, with the man sitting there looking at a photo (is that what he''s looking at?), with the line of trees on each side, all the leaves on the floor - this is just right for nostalgia.  It''s making me homesick right now, even though I don''t know what for.  I love the sepia tones - they, and the picture, are very well done.  My favourite!  ~10', '2003-09-15 23:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(420204, 36540, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent picture.  Well framed, good use of B&amp;W.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is an excellent picture.  Well framed, good use of B&W.  Nice job!', '2003-09-16 00:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(420205, 37209, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great nostalgic photo. I like the set up and the feeling of your shot. I even like the torn stool in front. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Great nostalgic photo. I like the set up and the feeling of your shot. I even like the torn stool in front. One of my favorites.', '2003-09-16 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(420207, 37022, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  This is an expressive photo.  Good work!</td>', 'Very nicely done.  This is an expressive photo.  Good work!', '2003-09-16 00:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(420208, 37231, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2003-09-16 00:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(420211, 37226, 3306, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. I would have like a little better lighting and focus.</td>', 'Creative idea. I would have like a little better lighting and focus.', '2003-09-16 00:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(420225, 36981, 6325, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2003-09-16 00:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(420227, 37117, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea for the challenge.  It seems there may be too much light, especially on the pictures to the right.  It might also be better with a few less photos, but that''s the only thing I can come up with.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is a good idea for the challenge.  It seems there may be too much light, especially on the pictures to the right.  It might also be better with a few less photos, but that''s the only thing I can come up with.  Nice work!', '2003-09-16 00:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(420232, 37050, 6325, '<td valign="top">I  really like this even though I cannot see the connection to the challenge - but that doesn''t matter that much anyway. Intriguing questions raised.</td>', 'I  really like this even though I cannot see the connection to the challenge - but that doesn''t matter that much anyway. Intriguing questions raised.', '2003-09-16 00:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(420235, 36817, 8125, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice title.  I''d love to go back to the day before a buck was only a half gallon!  :-)  Good choice for this challenge...</td>', 'Nice idea, nice title.  I''d love to go back to the day before a buck was only a half gallon!  :-)  Good choice for this challenge...', '2003-09-16 00:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(420237, 37059, 8125, '<td valign="top">I remember those days!</td>', 'I remember those days!', '2003-09-16 00:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(420239, 36574, 8125, '<td valign="top">Is this in Cedarburg, Wi???   Either way, nice work with the reflection</td>', 'Is this in Cedarburg, Wi???   Either way, nice work with the reflection', '2003-09-16 00:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(420243, 36947, 8125, '<td valign="top">My only comment here is the sky looks a little ''blown out''.  The village turned out nice - looks like a painting.</td>', 'My only comment here is the sky looks a little ''blown out''.  The village turned out nice - looks like a painting.', '2003-09-16 00:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(420245, 36634, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  One of my favorites in the challenge so far.  Good work! - 10</td>', 'Excellent photo.  One of my favorites in the challenge so far.  Good work! - 10', '2003-09-16 00:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(420250, 37136, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea - I think I''d like to see it with less of the floor though...</td>', 'This is a good idea - I think I''d like to see it with less of the floor though...', '2003-09-16 00:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(420252, 36860, 8125, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little bright - was it just overcast that day?  Love the building and trees.  The ripples through the reflection are nice as well.  Good work!</td>', 'The sky looks a little bright - was it just overcast that day?  Love the building and trees.  The ripples through the reflection are nice as well.  Good work!', '2003-09-16 00:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(420255, 36299, 12179, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Reminds me of my youth going on vacation in Florida</td>', 'Nice shot. Reminds me of my youth going on vacation in Florida', '2003-09-16 01:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(420256, 37170, 12179, '<td valign="top">Trippy!  I like the effect</td>', 'Trippy!  I like the effect', '2003-09-16 01:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(420257, 37136, 12179, '<td valign="top">My floors look like this (upon close inspection!) Good shot/idea.</td>', 'My floors look like this (upon close inspection!) Good shot/idea.', '2003-09-16 01:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(420258, 36805, 12179, '<td valign="top">Nice sunglasses shot! Sharp and crisp.</td>', 'Nice sunglasses shot! Sharp and crisp.', '2003-09-16 01:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
