(420271, 36667, 12179, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Subdued background light and perfect composition. Like how the light through the spaces between beads reflects on the wall!</td>', 'Very nice! Subdued background light and perfect composition. Like how the light through the spaces between beads reflects on the wall!', '2003-09-16 01:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
