(420550, 36602, 2764, '<td valign="top">Now I''m done and I did find one (only one) that I liked better.  Beautiful -  So many many subtle details.  The date 1945, the miliary uniform on th man to the left. the sedding ring catching the light, the true sepia tone.  Thier hands are great, Rule of thirds works well.  great compsoition and selective focus.  Very nice!!!  changed my mind - 10</td>', 'Now I''m done and I did find one (only one) that I liked better.  Beautiful -  So many many subtle details.  The date 1945, the miliary uniform on th man to the left. the sedding ring catching the light, the true sepia tone.  Thier hands are great, Rule of thirds works well.  great compsoition and selective focus.  Very nice!!!  changed my mind - 10', '2003-09-16 11:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
