(420948, 36730, 12187, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of my high school''s senior class trip to Italy.  I stood right where this photographer stood about 2 and 1/2 years ago.  I was taken back to that day in Venice the moment I laid eyes on this photo. . .to how child like I felt while there and to how much I wanted to take this city in because I did not know when, if ever, I would return.  Basicly, it touched me and I love it for that.</td>', 'This reminds me of my high school''s senior class trip to Italy.  I stood right where this photographer stood about 2 and 1/2 years ago.  I was taken back to that day in Venice the moment I laid eyes on this photo. . .to how child like I felt while there and to how much I wanted to take this city in because I did not know when, if ever, I would return.  Basicly, it touched me and I love it for that.', '2003-09-16 22:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
