(420974, 36974, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Love the reflections and the shadows in the horse. The blurring of the head of the horse makes it seem alive. The dark background really makes the white horse pop out of the picture.</td>', 'Good composition. Love the reflections and the shadows in the horse. The blurring of the head of the horse makes it seem alive. The dark background really makes the white horse pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-17 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
