(420977, 37020, 10084, '<td valign="top">The angle you used really makes the watertower look really big. The blue hues in the sky and the fluffy clouds really push the tower forward. It pops it right out of the picture. You were able to capture some beautiful shadows in the tower. Great depth of field. Tower, mountains, and then the sky. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'The angle you used really makes the watertower look really big. The blue hues in the sky and the fluffy clouds really push the tower forward. It pops it right out of the picture. You were able to capture some beautiful shadows in the tower. Great depth of field. Tower, mountains, and then the sky. Beautiful shot.', '2003-09-17 00:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(420978, 36634, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very authentic picture. I like how the lighting is focus in on the lady and really hi-lights here. Even if this is a still photo the spinning wheel really make it seem dynamic. You can almost feel her spinning the yarn.</td>', 'Very authentic picture. I like how the lighting is focus in on the lady and really hi-lights here. Even if this is a still photo the spinning wheel really make it seem dynamic. You can almost feel her spinning the yarn.', '2003-09-17 00:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(420979, 36669, 10084, '<td valign="top">Even with the glare on the side of the car. It''s not too distracting. Your eyes are automatically focused in on the shiny chrome on the hood. I like that you chose a low angle for the shot. Gives the car a looming monsterous feel to it. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Even with the glare on the side of the car. It''s not too distracting. Your eyes are automatically focused in on the shiny chrome on the hood. I like that you chose a low angle for the shot. Gives the car a looming monsterous feel to it. Beautiful shot.', '2003-09-17 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(420980, 36610, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b&amp;w shot. Composition is very interesting with the monument up front. You were able to capture some wonderful clouds. The sunlight peeking out is really nice. The silhouette of the landscape blends right in to the clouds. The framing really adds a nice touch to the piece.</td>', 'Beautiful b&w shot. Composition is very interesting with the monument up front. You were able to capture some wonderful clouds. The sunlight peeking out is really nice. The silhouette of the landscape blends right in to the clouds. The framing really adds a nice touch to the piece.', '2003-09-17 00:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(420982, 37129, 10084, '<td valign="top">The picture is a bit overexposed. This picture is extremely authentic. You were able to capture some really beautiful shadows in this piece. This really brings out the objects in this shot.</td>', 'The picture is a bit overexposed. This picture is extremely authentic. You were able to capture some really beautiful shadows in this piece. This really brings out the objects in this shot.', '2003-09-17 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(420983, 37233, 10084, '<td valign="top">A bit dark. You can still see some of the details. If lit correctly the suit of armors'' details would really shine. Composition is good. The figure seems to really be menacing and looming over you.</td>', 'A bit dark. You can still see some of the details. If lit correctly the suit of armors'' details would really shine. Composition is good. The figure seems to really be menacing and looming over you.', '2003-09-17 00:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(420984, 36996, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you used for this shot gives it a lot of interest. Some really nice shadow in the radio. The grill at the top really stands out in the radio. The light colored hand and arm really pops out of the picture because of the dark background. The colors you chose is excellent.</td>', 'I like the angle you used for this shot gives it a lot of interest. Some really nice shadow in the radio. The grill at the top really stands out in the radio. The light colored hand and arm really pops out of the picture because of the dark background. The colors you chose is excellent.', '2003-09-17 00:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(420986, 36817, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I wish that it had more depth of field. The pump blends in with the building in the background. More contrast may help.  The angle of the shot gives it a lot of interest. Nice potential for really great shadows to make the subject pop out of the picture.<br/>A little tweaking would definitely make this a great postcard or greeting card.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I wish that it had more depth of field. The pump blends in with the building in the background. More contrast may help.  The angle of the shot gives it a lot of interest. Nice potential for really great shadows to make the subject pop out of the picture.A little tweaking would definitely make this a great postcard or greeting card.', '2003-09-17 00:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(420988, 36845, 10084, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful focus in this shot. The chrome really shines because of this. I''m glad that you chose b&amp;w. Any other hues would not bring out the great shadows and reflections of the piece.<br/>I think that the frame is to small for the piece. A tiny bit larger would be nice. Don''t go too big.</td>', 'Really beautiful focus in this shot. The chrome really shines because of this. I''m glad that you chose b&w. Any other hues would not bring out the great shadows and reflections of the piece.I think that the frame is to small for the piece. A tiny bit larger would be nice. Don''t go too big.', '2003-09-17 00:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(420989, 36447, 7711, '<td valign="top">because of the sky, I''d have tried this in bw too, just to see if that would have more impact. also the front lamp is a bit distracting!</td>', 'because of the sky, I''d have tried this in bw too, just to see if that would have more impact. also the front lamp is a bit distracting!', '2003-09-17 00:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
