(421740, 36268, 1143, '<td valign="top">5.7? Technically this is an excellent shot. Great lighting, focus, dof. Maybe not enough emotion for the average voter, but I gave it a 7.</td>', '5.7? Technically this is an excellent shot. Great lighting, focus, dof. Maybe not enough emotion for the average voter, but I gave it a 7.', '2003-09-17 12:53:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(421745, 37053, 1143, '<td valign="top">Awe. This didn''t score as high as it should''ve. It definitely says nostalgia. One of the best fits for the topic IMO. I like how she''s snuggled down under the covers. The bedpost in the foreground is a bit big and bright maybe, but it adds some depth so I''m not sure I''d get rid of it anyway. Great emotion in this shot. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Awe. This didn''t score as high as it should''ve. It definitely says nostalgia. One of the best fits for the topic IMO. I like how she''s snuggled down under the covers. The bedpost in the foreground is a bit big and bright maybe, but it adds some depth so I''m not sure I''d get rid of it anyway. Great emotion in this shot. I gave it a 7.', '2003-09-17 12:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(421752, 36949, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really liked this, but it has a few quirks to iron out. That one bright white egg in the middle grabs the eye and maybe could be replaced by a brown one that isn''t so obvious. I''m also not sure what the heck that is behind the basket and think you should just remove it. It adds too much color and detracts from the nostalgia feel IMO. Love the lighting tho. Technically very nice image.</td>', 'I really liked this, but it has a few quirks to iron out. That one bright white egg in the middle grabs the eye and maybe could be replaced by a brown one that isn''t so obvious. I''m also not sure what the heck that is behind the basket and think you should just remove it. It adds too much color and detracts from the nostalgia feel IMO. Love the lighting tho. Technically very nice image.', '2003-09-17 13:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(421760, 37232, 1143, '<td valign="top">This shot must not have wide enough appeal. It was in my top ten, and I think it''s awesome. Technically one of the best in the challenge. My bf wasn''t too crazy about it though, and it obviously didn''t score as high as it should have. I love it. The blue, the dof, the composition. It''s great! Definitely can''t judge the merits of a photo based on dpc score.</td>', 'This shot must not have wide enough appeal. It was in my top ten, and I think it''s awesome. Technically one of the best in the challenge. My bf wasn''t too crazy about it though, and it obviously didn''t score as high as it should have. I love it. The blue, the dof, the composition. It''s great! Definitely can''t judge the merits of a photo based on dpc score.', '2003-09-17 13:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(421765, 36889, 6405, '<td valign="top">I did give it 10 and like this photo a lot,but looks illegal and many people give low scores because of that!</td>', 'I did give it 10 and like this photo a lot,but looks illegal and many people give low scores because of that!', '2003-09-17 13:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
