(421865, 36615, 7524, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments. This was my first entry in any of the contests. Good fun to see what others think of your photos. I actually put the house in because it''s my place. But it would have been better for this challenge without it.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the comments. This was my first entry in any of the contests. Good fun to see what others think of your photos. I actually put the house in because it''s my place. But it would have been better for this challenge without it.  ', '2003-09-17 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(421869, 36453, 11206, '<td valign="top">I Loved your picture alot and I also like using the same effect with some of my photos.  Not everybody likes doing or seeing this kind of funkieness.  I''m glad you did it though.  Wonderful!!</td>', 'I Loved your picture alot and I also like using the same effect with some of my photos.  Not everybody likes doing or seeing this kind of funkieness.  I''m glad you did it though.  Wonderful!!', '2003-09-17 14:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(421873, 36976, 3037, '<td valign="top">Never, and I repeat, never download a free copy of a photo editing program and expect it to resize the picture and look decent afterwards. That is my sin on this picture. My excuse...my compute was in storage for almost 2 weeks, as well as my CD of Photoshop.</td>', 'Never, and I repeat, never download a free copy of a photo editing program and expect it to resize the picture and look decent afterwards. That is my sin on this picture. My excuse...my compute was in storage for almost 2 weeks, as well as my CD of Photoshop.', '2003-09-17 14:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
