(421897, 37232, 4411, '<td valign="top">The only ''bad'' thing about this shot is the blown out area at the top, and even that doesn''t bother me too much. Love the DoF, focus is on the right spot, and the speedo becomes a less distracting part of the background. An excellent photograph.</td>', 'The only ''bad'' thing about this shot is the blown out area at the top, and even that doesn''t bother me too much. Love the DoF, focus is on the right spot, and the speedo becomes a less distracting part of the background. An excellent photograph.', '2003-09-17 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(421902, 36813, 4411, '<td valign="top">So where''s the rest of the shots? You lucky dawg ; )<br/>Forget the challenge, this is an excellent portrait. A clean background and less shadow would have been better, but I can''t fault the model &lt;cough&gt; I mean the exposure &amp; focus on the model! Keep ''em comin''.</td>', 'So where''s the rest of the shots? You lucky dawg ; )Forget the challenge, this is an excellent portrait. A clean background and less shadow would have been better, but I can''t fault the model <cough> I mean the exposure & focus on the model! Keep ''em comin''.', '2003-09-17 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(421908, 36981, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''m only going to repeat what has been said many times already ... the colours are superb! A great, simple image that grabs the viewers attention.</td>', 'I''m only going to repeat what has been said many times already ... the colours are superb! A great, simple image that grabs the viewers attention.', '2003-09-17 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(421914, 36795, 11793, '<td valign="top">appreciate the comments<br/>was trying to make the image appear to be old<br/> <br/>edit - removed dead link.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-12 18:01:03.</i></td>', 'appreciate the commentswas trying to make the image appear to be old edit - removed dead link.', '2003-09-17 15:03:22.000000', '2007-03-12 18:01:03.000000', 0),
(421916, 36680, 4411, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. My favourite of the entries I''ve looked through. Colour, composition &amp; detail are all great.</td>', 'Awesome shot. My favourite of the entries I''ve looked through. Colour, composition & detail are all great.', '2003-09-17 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(421980, 36961, 3867, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments everyone.  I too would have liked to crop this one in more but it was already cropped as much as I could.  The shot was taken at full zoom and the ship was quite far away.  One of you commented it was a bit grainy or blurry.  It would have been more so if I had cropped in even more so itt was a bit of a trade off.<br/> <br/>Now, as for the object in the distance on the right, it is another sailboat on the horizon.  I intentionally didn''t crop it out in order to add more dynamics to the shot and to draw the viewer in and captive his/her attention.  Some of you didn''t like the fact you couldn''t quit make it out.  But like it or not, it caught all of your attention and made you concentrate and focus on the image.  It held your attention, perhaps for just a second, but it held it and made you wonder.  And that, my friends, is the whole purpose of art.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-22 21:27:24.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments everyone.  I too would have liked to crop this one in more but it was already cropped as much as I could.  The shot was taken at full zoom and the ship was quite far away.  One of you commented it was a bit grainy or blurry.  It would have been more so if I had cropped in even more so itt was a bit of a trade off. Now, as for the object in the distance on the right, it is another sailboat on the horizon.  I intentionally didn''t crop it out in order to add more dynamics to the shot and to draw the viewer in and captive his/her attention.  Some of you didn''t like the fact you couldn''t quit make it out.  But like it or not, it caught all of your attention and made you concentrate and focus on the image.  It held your attention, perhaps for just a second, but it held it and made you wonder.  And that, my friends, is the whole purpose of art.', '2003-09-17 15:39:43.000000', '2003-09-22 22:27:24.000000', 0),
(421988, 36813, 6900, '<td valign="top">bod - I''ll have to mail you the cd. ;)  I''ve got about 400 of Karen on my computer - and another 100 to edit through.  If I post them up for her, I''ll make sure you get the link. hehe<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'bod - I''ll have to mail you the cd. ;)  I''ve got about 400 of Karen on my computer - and another 100 to edit through.  If I post them up for her, I''ll make sure you get the link. hehe M', '2003-09-17 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(421999, 36860, 11613, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting, it looks so good. It looks like art. I really think we should ban the 6 people that gave it a 3 or lower. It''s obviously done out of spite or to lower everyone else''s scores but their own.</td>', 'This looks like a painting, it looks so good. It looks like art. I really think we should ban the 6 people that gave it a 3 or lower. It''s obviously done out of spite or to lower everyone else''s scores but their own.', '2003-09-17 15:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
