(422323, 36813, 6870, '<td valign="top">You got her here at such a wonderful pose and expression. It''s not readily discernable what she''s thinking, so it keeps my interest. Your clarity and lighting help too. Nifty!</td>', 'You got her here at such a wonderful pose and expression. It''s not readily discernable what she''s thinking, so it keeps my interest. Your clarity and lighting help too. Nifty!', '2003-09-17 20:41:56.000000', NULL, 0),
