(423443, 37230, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know, I don''t think there is anything wrong with the watches being out of focus.  I can see how that would be a problem but it still seems like that gives it more language.  The focus gets more and more blurry as this very car or memory fades further into the past.  Does that make sense?  It''s like the memory is fading along with the item.</td>', 'You know, I don''t think there is anything wrong with the watches being out of focus.  I can see how that would be a problem but it still seems like that gives it more language.  The focus gets more and more blurry as this very car or memory fades further into the past.  Does that make sense?  It''s like the memory is fading along with the item.', '2003-09-18 18:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
