(423882, 37171, 2764, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite images from this challenge.  Great lighting.  Your placement of the figures and the careful direction of the lighting tells a whole little story about the wedding.  She''s shy, he''s confident.  She peeks at him out of the corner of her eye.  I like the contrast of the lace and the ceramic.  Should have placed MUCH higher.</td>', 'One of my favorite images from this challenge.  Great lighting.  Your placement of the figures and the careful direction of the lighting tells a whole little story about the wedding.  She''s shy, he''s confident.  She peeks at him out of the corner of her eye.  I like the contrast of the lace and the ceramic.  Should have placed MUCH higher.', '2003-09-19 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(424187, 36314, 11379, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by briphoto:</b></div><hr/><i>Don''t see any "Nostalgia" here, this looks like any number of playgrounds I see around town now.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>they are empty.  i hope i don''t have to explain it further... :/</td>', 'Originally posted by briphoto:Don''t see any "Nostalgia" here, this looks like any number of playgrounds I see around town now.  they are empty.  i hope i don''t have to explain it further... :/', '2003-09-19 16:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(424282, 36862, 2716, '<td valign="top">Hey bro,  great first entry.  Totally love the tones of the shot and the seagull really adds some punch to the shot, even though its tiny in the scheme of things. Super composition. Keep up the good work.  <br/> <br/>Your little bro, Jacko.</td>', 'Hey bro,  great first entry.  Totally love the tones of the shot and the seagull really adds some punch to the shot, even though its tiny in the scheme of things. Super composition. Keep up the good work.   Your little bro, Jacko.', '2003-09-19 21:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(424719, 37142, 3469, '<td valign="top">I have been away for a short period, therefore I can only now (4 days after the challenge ended) say thank you for the many nice and constructive comments that this picture got.<br/>Since I have been accused earlier of "trying to shoehorn in (i.e. into the challenge) a picture that doesn''t fit by giving it a pretense in the title" I decided to submit it as ''untitled''. To me the picture speaks for itself and I am glad that many other members felt the same way. Thank you.<br/></td>', 'I have been away for a short period, therefore I can only now (4 days after the challenge ended) say thank you for the many nice and constructive comments that this picture got.Since I have been accused earlier of "trying to shoehorn in (i.e. into the challenge) a picture that doesn''t fit by giving it a pretense in the title" I decided to submit it as ''untitled''. To me the picture speaks for itself and I am glad that many other members felt the same way. Thank you.', '2003-09-20 17:01:03.000000', NULL, 0),
