(427393, 37147, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like how you were able to capture the beautiful shadows in the flag. The wrinkling really helps to make it dramatic. Good composition. It help to bring the flag to your eyes.</td>', 'I like how you were able to capture the beautiful shadows in the flag. The wrinkling really helps to make it dramatic. Good composition. It help to bring the flag to your eyes.', '2003-09-23 18:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
