(435672, 36526, 10084, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a feeling of nostaligia, but I feel that this would be a good picture for questioning the place of religion in the United States currently. The thinker and the bible what a concept. <br/> <br/>Lighting is really good on both the thinker statue and the bible. The bright light on the bible gives it a halo and brings out the point of religion more.<br/> <br/>I think a larger white frame may help bring out the picture more then a smaller one.</td>', 'I don''t get a feeling of nostaligia, but I feel that this would be a good picture for questioning the place of religion in the United States currently. The thinker and the bible what a concept.  Lighting is really good on both the thinker statue and the bible. The bright light on the bible gives it a halo and brings out the point of religion more. I think a larger white frame may help bring out the picture more then a smaller one.', '2003-09-30 19:44:28.000000', NULL, 0),
