(658611, 36272, 19787, '<td valign="top">Terrific picture! I love the Misfits! I grew up with them too. The Jem cartoon was one of the most intelligent cartoons ever made for kids, and when I watch it today, it still makes sense to me, even now that I''m in my twenties.Your photo brought back wonderful memories. Great work!</td>', 'Terrific picture! I love the Misfits! I grew up with them too. The Jem cartoon was one of the most intelligent cartoons ever made for kids, and when I watch it today, it still makes sense to me, even now that I''m in my twenties.Your photo brought back wonderful memories. Great work!', '2004-04-07 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(806493, 37131, 12611, '<td valign="top">I look for shots like this all day long. This is a heck of a shot. The composition, lighting, and color are all superb. If this is Sweden, get the toast and lingonberry jam ready, cause it looks like a wonderful place to call home.</td>', 'I look for shots like this all day long. This is a heck of a shot. The composition, lighting, and color are all superb. If this is Sweden, get the toast and lingonberry jam ready, cause it looks like a wonderful place to call home.', '2004-07-11 23:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1184055, 36441, 33560, '<td valign="top">The costume is fantastic.  The model''s expression is priceless.  I like the brick wall   The vat is an interesting touch, but it seems a little non-martial and it interferes with the rifle.  And as much as I love to photograph dead wood, I think the stick is  better left out .  I think the shot might be better with a little more bokeh.  <br/> <br/>A nice effort.</td>', 'The costume is fantastic.  The model''s expression is priceless.  I like the brick wall   The vat is an interesting touch, but it seems a little non-martial and it interferes with the rifle.  And as much as I love to photograph dead wood, I think the stick is  better left out .  I think the shot might be better with a little more bokeh.   A nice effort.', '2005-02-20 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
