(1502437, 36813, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait.  Simple and not overdone in any aspect.  Her pose is natural and has a wistful air to it. The sepia puts a melancholy twist on it. I like the hair tumbling over her shoulders. Very nice!!</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait.  Simple and not overdone in any aspect.  Her pose is natural and has a wistful air to it. The sepia puts a melancholy twist on it. I like the hair tumbling over her shoulders. Very nice!!', '2005-07-03 21:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623306, 36730, 18932, '<td valign="top">The subject is great, the colour is good, the textures are helpful. The lights are a bit distracting. As are the posts, if you could I would have tried to frame it so that the tower was not obstructed at all, however despite all that, a very nice photo.</td>', 'The subject is great, the colour is good, the textures are helpful. The lights are a bit distracting. As are the posts, if you could I would have tried to frame it so that the tower was not obstructed at all, however despite all that, a very nice photo.', '2005-08-19 07:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
